},
{
"t0": 85.6,
"t1": 89.6,
"kind": "block",
"text": "你的工位， / 就是你的山。",
"fx": [
"uline"
]
},
{
"t0": 89.8,
"t1": 93.2,
"kind": "block",
"text": "你的 KPI， / 就是你的石头。",
